sio/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ab9b3ed8/uploads/origins/494db36a-d02b-48c8-acca-f8f7c42ac5ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da2037f2048f2b082d7fd1c5783e113c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ab9b3ed8/uploads/origins/494db36a-d02b-48c8-acca-f8f7c42ac5ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da2037f2048f2b082d7fd1c5783e113c, https://si.imgix.net/ab9b3ed8/uploads/origins/494db36a-d02b-48c8-acca-f8f7c42ac5ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64c0d162254f987c8860b40cc0a1c6ce 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ab9b3ed8/uploads/origins/494db36a-d02b-48c8-acca-f8f7c42ac5ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=767714f75318e85a066ff6a453be355e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hihi! Your style is adorable!\n\nI would like to commission my an illustration of my VTuber character. She is a kind and shy magical girl who loves helping others, but can be clumsy at times. She has starry eyes and blonde highlights on her side bangs and tips of hair. Her outfit is themed around wishes and hope, with shooting stars and wings as a common theme. A star hangs off the wing to the right.\n\nI would like for her to be wearing a mouse ear headband, while she is eating some cheese yakisoba ! The setting and pose details aside from that are up to you.\n\nReference:\nhttps://prnt.sc/Q0dHtmisYbxq\n\nHeight: 160cm\nBust: B cup\n\nThank you for your consideration!!\n\nhttps://prnt.sc/Q0dHtmisYbxq", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@masi_masio/works/33", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/21289c92/uploads/origins/fb3b5630-b690-41f2-ba30-86ac1cf11102?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee2f69172088e27f904057220b6357ad", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/21289c92/uploads/origins/fb3b5630-b690-41f2-ba30-86ac1cf11102?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ee2f69172088e27f904057220b6357ad, https://si.imgix.net/21289c92/uploads/origins/fb3b5630-b690-41f2-ba30-86ac1cf11102?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=debdc0ea3c831b4d49d83632742d3928 2x, https://si.imgix.net/21289c92/uploads/origins/fb3b5630-b690-41f2-ba30-86ac1cf11102?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=13fe1c3d1e1e14244a5c93a40a428f7f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello\n\nI want to ask you to draw a artwork for birthday celebration to Vtuber 夢咲ミア:\n\nI hope you can draw ミア holding a birthday cake and add cute rabbit ears and tail to her. Please design a new dress to ミア.\n\n夢咲ミアの三面図:\nhttps://twitter.com/yumesakimia/status/1311970729387159554\nhttps://twitter.com/bouzumi_/status/1311629644748079104\nhttps://twitter.com/yumesakimia/status/1534547109898502144\n\nI hope it can post on Twitter and use to be Youtube video front cover for ミア.\n\nThank you very much!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@masi_masio/works/32", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/10437d8c/uploads/origins/5373bd21-01cb-418a-8ef3-9ef939ae8bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=229dda857f2e78c634397cde5a4d5ddf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/10437d8c/uploads/origins/5373bd21-01cb-418a-8ef3-9ef939ae8bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=229dda857f2e78c634397cde5a4d5ddf, https://si.imgix.net/10437d8c/uploads/origins/5373bd21-01cb-418a-8ef3-9ef939ae8bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7118aca3a4277867966bce4c3fef5c9f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/10437d8c/uploads/origins/5373bd21-01cb-418a-8ef3-9ef939ae8bd9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=54afa5d908b7c01099ef26cc976bc783 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "真汐様 初めまして、\nVTuberの猫魔しろあと申します。\n\nhttps:/